title: Proxmox Backup Server: Node Memory
agents: pbs
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors RAM and swap usage of a Proxmox Backup Server node. Data
 is collected via the special agent {agent_pbs} from the {/nodes/<node>/status}
 REST API endpoint.

 The service goes {WARN}/{CRIT} when RAM usage exceeds the configured
 percentage levels (default 80/90%). Swap usage is shown for information.

discovery:
 One service {PBS Node Memory} is created if memory data is available.
